{"title":"GLOVES","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"how-gloves","title":"HOW Gloves","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHOW Gloves\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e are designed for players who demand a smooth, consistent stroke with unrestricted hand movement. Built with a lightweight and flexible construction, these billiard gloves create a low-friction surface between the bridge hand and cue shaft, allowing the cue to glide smoothly through the fingers for greater stroke consistency and control.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe back of the glove features \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehigh-stretch Lycra\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, providing flexibility and breathability for comfortable play during extended sessions. A \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ereinforced anti-slip palm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e adds stability and durability, helping maintain a secure bridge position while allowing natural movement throughout the stroke.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eHigh-stretch \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLycra back\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for flexibility and breathability\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eReinforced \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eanti-slip palm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for added stability\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight construction for comfortable extended play\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eClose, comfortable fit without restricting hand movement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmooth surface designed to reduce friction against the cue shaft\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHelps promote a smoother and more consistent stroke\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eAvailable for \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eleft and right hands\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eAvailable in \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eXS, S\/M, L\/XL, and 2XL\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable in multiple colors\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable Colors\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArmy Green, Black, Deep Pink, Dream Purple, Grey, Lemon Yellow, Mint Blue, Navy Blue, Peacock Blue, Rose Pink, Sakura Pink, and Wine Red\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a lightweight, breathable, and flexible billiard glove that provides \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003esmooth cue movement, a stable bridge, and consistent performance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from practice sessions to competitive play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmooth movement. Secure control. Consistent strokes. HOW Gloves are made to keep your game flowing.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487153717296,"sku":null,"price":1700.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/file